OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GGreat concert performances from
OL,6,     Garound the world, including the
OL,7,     GBBC National Orchestra of Wales
OL,8,     Gwith Beethoven, chamber music
OL,9,     Gfrom Birmingham and live piano
OL,10,     Gmusic from Wigmore Hall.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Erik
OL,12,     FChisholm
OL,13,     GKate Molleson, with Dr John
OL,14,     GPurser, traces Chisholm's early
OL,15,     Glife, folk inspirations and first
OL,16,     Gsteps in music.
OL,17,G1700FIn Tune
OL,18,     GKatie Derham presents live music
OL,19,     Gfrom pianist Alexandra Dariescu,
OL,20,     Gplus writer Susan Wokoma talks
OL,21,     Gabout the new musical 'Handel and
OL,22,     GHendrix'.
