OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 FEB
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,7,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,8,     GLudovic Morlot conducts the
OL,9,     GBournemouth Symphony Orchestra in
OL,10,     GSpanish music including Ravel's
OL,11,     Giconic Bolero and de Falla's
OL,12,     GNights in the Gardens of Spain
OL,13,     Gwith Steven Osborne.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: Almost Famous
OL,15,     GIan Sansom reflects on obscurity
OL,16,     Gas an index of cultural values
OL,17,     Gthrough five figures whose
OL,18,     Greputations offer a map of
OL,19,     Gshifting tastes, beginning with
OL,20,     Gcomposer Granville Bantock.
